===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|XY|Electrode|45}} from the {{TCG|XY}} expansion.
*'''Tumbling Attack''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Giovanni's Nidoking|7}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
